.TH path_relative_to 3
.SH NAME
path_relative_to \- compute a relative path
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "path.h"
.PP
.BI "int path_relative_to(const char *" path ", const char *" relative_to ", stralloc *" out ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B path_relative_to
computes the relative path from the directory
.I relative_to
to the target
.IR path .
The resulting relative path string is appended to the
.I out
stralloc. It returns 1 on success and 0 if a relative path could not be computed
(e.g., paths are on different drives/partitions).
.SH SEE ALSO
path_relative_to_sa(3)